<title>USA: Farallon group has United Stationers stake.</title>
<headline>Farallon group has United Stationers stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Farallon Capital Partners L.P. Thursday said it has acquired a 6.3 percent stake or 726,308 common shares of United Stationers Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the Farallon group said it bought some of the shares between Jan. 8 and Feb. 12 at prices ranging from $19.55 to $20.86 per share.</p>
<p>It said it acquired the stake for investment.</p>
</text>
